# Abilities that trigger when a player sacrifices a permanent look back in time (CR 603.10a): they trigger from the board
# as it was just before the event, so a permanent sacrificed together with what it watches still sees it. Bot1 casts
# Pitiless Carnage and sacrifices Tireless Tracker with its Clue, and Baloth Prime with a Forest, all at once. Both
# "Whenever you sacrifice a Clue" and "Whenever you sacrifice a land" trigger: Bot1 is asked to order the two, the stack then holds both, and
# Baloth Prime's makes its tapped 4/4 Beast (the untap and the +1/+1 counter find nothing, their permanents gone).

[Bot1 Deck]
Tireless Tracker
Baloth Prime
Pitiless Carnage
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Forest
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x14

